Curtis stared at the ceiling, then at the screen.
Rio Kamichika wanted a door he was not behind.
On the fifth floor, the suite had music, a reconstructed girl, and a classmate who still thought he was only tired —
and Curtis Nightstar had to answer without turning two kindnesses into a collision before morning.
Curtis thumbed the reply with the blazer off and the suite lights low.
